---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_state: sale not ended
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_check_published: sale ended
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: TGE details already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert TgeDetailsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set_token: TGE details not yet published
    q_set_token --> q_set_details: set askToken address
    q_set_details --> [*]: set TGE details, tgePublished = true, emit TgeDetailsPublished

    note right of q_set_token
        INV-001: askToken address set during TGE publication (not at init)
        INV-002: TGE details can only be published once
    end note
